#: data/io.github.wuzi.Cue.metainfo.xml:9
msgid ""
"Cue is a focused scratchpad for quick notes and one-time reminders. Write "
"directly on the canvas, then add an English schedule such as “@tomorrow 9am” "
"when a note should notify you."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.wuzi.Cue.metainfo.xml:14
msgid ""
"Notes and reminders stay on your device. Complete or snooze reminders from "
"the notification, review upcoming reminders by day, and keep a local history "
"of completed items."
msgstr ""

